# Client St0r fail2ban integration (v3.17.597)
#
# Intentionally has no rules. This file used to grant passwordless
# `fail2ban-client` with any arguments, and fail2ban-client can set a jail's ban
# action to an arbitrary command, so it was root for the app user. The app now
# reaches fail2ban only through the root helper (deploy/root-helper/), which
# allows ping, status, unban and start, and checks the jail name and IP.
